Judg 14:1 , Samson desires a wife of the Philistines;
Judg 14:6 , In his journey he kills a lion;
Judg 14:8 , In a second journey he finds honey in the carcase;
Judg 14:10 , Samson's marriage feast;
Judg 14:12 , His riddle by his wife is made known;
Judg 14:19 , He spoils thirty Philistines;
Judg 14:20 , His wife is married to another.
